        "- e-NAM purpose, 2016 launch anchor, participating mandis, electronic auction, single licence/fee prerequisites, assaying, logistics, payment and dispute-resolution limits.",
        "- FPO purpose, SFAC and support institutions, aggregation economics, professional management, working capital, buyer linkage, governance and FPO/cooperative distinction.",
